      "summaries": {
        "en": "SpacetimeDB is a relational database that embeds directly into applications, eliminating the need for separate database servers and complex networking layers. Its key innovation is using a deterministic, event-sourced architecture where all state changes are recorded as immutable events, enabling perfect replication and time-travel debugging. Developers can build multiplayer games, real-time collaborative tools, or financial applications by writing business logic in Rust modules that run within the database, with automatic conflict resolution and consistent state across all clients.",
        "zh": "SpacetimeDB 是一款可直接嵌入应用的关系型数据库，通过消除独立数据库服务器和复杂网络层来简化开发流程。其核心技术采用确定性事件溯源架构，将所有状态变化记录为不可变事件，实现了完美的数据复制和时间旅行调试功能。开发者可以用 Rust 编写业务逻辑模块在数据库内运行，特别适合构建多人在线游戏、实时协作工具或金融应用，系统会自动处理冲突并保持所有客户端状态一致性，让分布式系统开发变得像编写单机程序一样直观。",
        "es": "SpacetimeDB is a relational database that embeds directly into applications, eliminating the need for separate database servers and complex networking layers. Its key innovation is using a deterministic, event-sourced architecture where all state changes are recorded as immutable events, enabling perfect replication and time-travel debugging. Developers can build multiplayer games, real-time collaborative tools, or financial applications by writing business logic in Rust modules that run within the database, with automatic conflict resolution and consistent state across all clients.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "SpacetimeDB stands out for database, dataoriented, and game-development in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "SpacetimeDB is a relational database that embeds directly into applications, eliminating the need for separate database servers and complex networking layers. Its key innovation is using a deterministic, event-sourced architecture where all state changes are recorded as immutable events, enabling perfect replication and time-travel debugging. Developers can build multiplayer games, real-time collaborative tools, or financial applications by writing business logic in Rust modules that run within the database, with automatic conflict resolution and consistent state across all clients.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/clockworklabs/SpacetimeDB for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
